From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hugo223 <slimstalker@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:46:26 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] tu: only force per-sample interpolation for shaders that use it

vkd3d-proton sets sampleShadingEnable for the whole pipeline as soon as
any stage declares the SampleRateShading SPIR-V capability
(libs/vkd3d/state.c).  That capability says nothing about real use:
dxil-spirv adds it while translating declarations and opcodes such as
sample interpolants, SV_SampleIndex or dx.op.sampleIndex, and the shader
that ends up in the pipeline may consume none of that.

Mesa's SPIR-V front end already computes the honest answer:
spirv_to_nir sets uses_sample_shading only when the shader statically
uses SampleId, SamplePosition or an input decorated with Sample, so
declared but unused inputs do not count.

Turnip then overrides that answer: tu_pipeline sets force_sample_interp
from sampleShadingEnable, and tu_lower_nir sets uses_sample_shading and
marks every non-centroid input as sample.  The fragment shader then runs
at sample rate (x4 at 4 samples) with all inputs interpolated per
sample and early-Z force-disabled (tu_cmd_buffer.cc), which costs 27% in
Teardown (Winlator + vkd3d-proton) on A840: 40 FPS against 55 FPS for
the proprietary driver doing the same drawing.

Respect the static use result instead.  When the shader really consumes
per-sample data, nothing changes: uses_sample_shading is already true and
the old code path is taken.  When it does not, the pipeline-level
request no longer escalates the shader to per-sample mode.  Non-Sample
inputs need not be evaluated independently for each sample, and one
invocation still shades all covered samples.

Tested on Adreno 840 (SM8850) with Teardown (Winlator + vkd3d-proton):
40 -> 55 FPS, matching the proprietary driver.

Signed-off-by: Hugo223 <slimstalker@gmail.com>
Generated-by: LLM
---
 src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_shader.cc | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_shader.cc b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_shader.cc
index 45e173236dc..0e7dd3ca789 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_shader.cc
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_shader.cc
@@ -3578,8 +3578,8 @@ tu_lower_nir(struct tu_device *dev,
    if (!key->multiview_mask)
       tu_nir_lower_view_to_zero(nir);
 
-   if (nir->info.stage == MESA_SHADER_FRAGMENT && key->force_sample_interp) {
-      nir->info.fs.uses_sample_shading = true;
+   if (nir->info.stage == MESA_SHADER_FRAGMENT && key->force_sample_interp &&
+       nir->info.fs.uses_sample_shading) {
       nir_foreach_shader_in_variable(var, nir) {
          if (!var->data.centroid)
             var->data.sample = true;
